The pattern followed here is,

P + 5 = U;

U - 3 = R;

R + 5 = W;

W - 3 = T;

T + 5 = **Y;**

**Y **- 3 = V;

V + 5 = A;

A - 3 = X

Hence, Y is the correct answer.
